{"page": 5, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 15, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Native: fish, geese (nēnē), ‘īlima, koa, mountain raspberry (‘ākala), olonā • Non-Native: banana (maiʻa), breadfruit (‘ulu), candlenut (kukui), chicken (moa), coconut (niu), dogs (ʻīlio), gourds (ipu), milo, mountain apple (‘ōhi‘a‘ai), mulberry (wauke), pigs (puaʻa), sweet potato (‘uala), sugarcane (kō), taro (kalo), ti leaves", "id": "u124", "furniture": false}
