{"page": 9, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 15, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Specialization of Labor: allowed for increased productivity, expertise, and efficiency • Exchange of Goods and Services: led to an increased standard of living for all", "id": "u228", "furniture": false}
